    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35487" root="قرشب" body-key="q">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قِرْشَبٌّ</span></b>  <i>Advanced in years:</i> (As, S, K:) applied
to a man. (S.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  One <i>who is in a bad state,</i> or
<i>condition.</i> (IAar, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  A man <i>of bad disposition.</i> (Kr, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <i>Having a capacious belly.</i>
(K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  <i>A great eater; voracious.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b6-  A
man (TA) <i>corpulent, or bulky, and tall.</i> (K.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b7-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">القِرْشَبٌّ</span> <i>The lion.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b8-  Pl. (in each of
the above senses, TA) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَرَاشِبُ</span>. (K.) [See also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كِرْشَبٌّ</span>.]

